  m_Name: Template_among_the_refugees
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DeadWalls::DeadWalls.CouncilTemplateSO
  Id: among_the_refugees
  Title: AMONG THE REFUGEES
  Body: One of the newcomers is a guild craftsman who can restore the Wall or reorganize
    a production yard.
  BodyVariants:
  - "One of the newcomers is a guild craftsman \u2014 the kind cities used to fight
    over. He can spend the day resetting the Wall, or reorganize one yard before
    opening his workshop."
  - 'The newcomers have been inside for two days when the yard foreman recognizes
    a guild mason among them. He offers one favor: restore the Wall, or put one production
    yard back in order.'
  OutcomeA: He spends the day at the Wall, resetting stone and braces. The damage
    is repaired by {HEAL_PCT}%.
  OutcomeB: He reorganizes the {BOOST_RES} yards before opening his workshop. Output
    is up {BOOST_PCT}% for {BOOST_D} days.
  Contrast: 6
  OptionAAtomIds:
  - heal_defense
  OptionBAtomIds:
  - boost_production
  OptionAVerb: Repair the Wall
  OptionBVerb: Rework the yards
  BaseWeight: 2
  MinDay: 1
  RequiredFlags:
  - refugees_taken
  ForbiddenFlags: []
  SetsFlagOnA: 
  SetsFlagOnB: 
  ChainDelayDays: 2
  OneShot: 1
